# klogs: a workload's pods merged into one stream
Output docs/klogs.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 560
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "klogs"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "deploy api"
Sleep 1200ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
